{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19536","headline":"和张相公太原亭怀古诗 · 胡[证]","name":"和张相公太原亭怀古诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞泉天台状，峭石蓬莱姿。\n潺湲与青翠，咫尺当幽奇。\n居然尽精道，得以书妍词。\n岂无他山胜，懿此清轩墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡[证]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19536.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19536","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}